WEBVTT

00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:02.601
Or an asylum seeker
from Sub-Saharan Africa?

00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:07.917
Or someone who's recently crossed
the US-Mexican border?

00:08:09.417 --> 00:08:12.643
You may not have a total objection,

00:08:12.667 --> 00:08:15.167
but you may have a concern.

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:21.976
A qualm that scratches
at the back of your brain.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.309
It's not because
of the color of their skin.

00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:28.809
But because you know
that in countries like ours,

00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:30.976
as things stand now,